From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winegstreamer: a buffer flushed while the PE side copies it

The PE side takes a stream's buffer (get_buffer: its size), copies it
piece by piece (copy_buffer) and releases it. A flush in between (a seek:
DirectShow reads a file's start to find its format and seeks back to 0)
unmapped that buffer, and the next one could take its place before the
PE side went on: it then copied from the new buffer by the old one's size
and released the new one unsent. With buffers all of one size that went
unseen; the first WMA buffer after the seek is shorter since gst1-libav's
patch 0001 drops the samples FFmpeg asks to skip, and Корсары (Pirates of
the Caribbean) died on its first WMV video:

  wg_parser_stream_copy_buffer: Assertion `offset + size <=
  stream->map_info.size' failed.

A flush now marks a buffer given out as stale: copying from it is
refused as from a flushed pin (the PE side already handles that), and its
release leaves the buffer now in its place alone, to be got next.
---
--- a/dlls/winegstreamer/wg_parser.c
+++ b/dlls/winegstreamer/wg_parser.c
@@ -116,6 +116,12 @@
     GstMapInfo map_info;
 
     bool flushing, eos, enabled, has_tags, has_buffer, no_more_pads;
+    /* handed_out: the buffer was given to the PE side (get_buffer), which
+     * copies from it and then releases it. stale: a flush took that buffer
+     * away meanwhile; another one may already be in its place, and the PE
+     * side must neither copy from that one by the old buffer's offsets and
+     * size nor release it. */
+    bool handed_out, stale;
 
     uint64_t duration;
     gchar *tags[WG_PARSER_TAG_COUNT];
@@ -376,6 +382,8 @@
     wg_buffer->delta = GST_BUFFER_FLAG_IS_SET(buffer, GST_BUFFER_FLAG_DELTA_UNIT);
     wg_buffer->size = gst_buffer_get_size(buffer);
     wg_buffer->stream = stream->number;
+    stream->handed_out = true;
+    stream->stale = false;
 
     pthread_mutex_unlock(&parser->mutex);
     return S_OK;
@@ -391,7 +399,8 @@
 
     pthread_mutex_lock(&parser->mutex);
 
-    if (!stream->buffer)
+    /* stale: flushed after get_buffer, as when nothing is there */
+    if (!stream->buffer || stream->stale)
     {
         pthread_mutex_unlock(&parser->mutex);
         return VFW_E_WRONG_STATE;
@@ -412,6 +421,14 @@
 
     pthread_mutex_lock(&parser->mutex);
 
+    /* the buffer given out went with a flush: the one there now is not it */
+    if (stream->stale)
+    {
+        stream->stale = false;
+        pthread_mutex_unlock(&parser->mutex);
+        return S_OK;
+    }
+    stream->handed_out = false;
     if (stream->buffer)
     {
         gst_buffer_unmap(stream->buffer, &stream->map_info);
@@ -659,6 +676,12 @@
                 gst_buffer_unmap(stream->buffer, &stream->map_info);
                 gst_buffer_unref(stream->buffer);
                 stream->buffer = NULL;
+                /* the PE side may still be copying from it (Корсары' WMV
+                 * videos: the first WMA buffer after DirectShow's seek back
+                 * to 0 is shorter, patch gst1-libav 0001, and the copy by
+                 * the old size ran past the new one) */
+                stream->stale = stream->handed_out;
+                stream->handed_out = false;
             }
 
             pthread_mutex_unlock(&parser->mutex);
